    "stem": "A 28-year-old pregnant woman at 39\nweeks of gestation presents to the labor\nand delivery unit with regular\ncontractions. On cervical examination,\nthe following findings are noted:\ncervical dilation: 5 cm; cervical\neffacement: 70%; cervical consistency:\nsoft; cervical position: anterior, fetal\nstation: -1. Her Bishop score suggests\n:\n___",
