    "subject": "obstetrics-gynecology",
    "originalNumber": 2,
    "stem": "A 25 year old primipara gives birth to a neonate\nwith IUGR, microcephaly, craniofacial\ndysmorphism, hypopastic nails and distal\nphalanges. Which of the following teratogen may\nbe responsible for this?",
