    "explanation": "In this case wherein the cyst is asymptomatic and\nthere is no sign of infection or abscess (being\nnontender), expectant management is advised.\nHowever for a large painful Bartholin's, a word\ncatheter is palced to releive the obstruction.\nMarsupialziation is typically reserved for patients\nin whom the catheter has failed",
