    "correctChoice": "D",
    "explanation": "The findings and symptoms are consistent with\nTrichomonas vaginalis infection. The classic\ncervical finding is a strawberry looking appearance.\nMotile flagellated protozopans are visible on wet\nprep microscopic exam.",
