    "subject": "obstetrics-gynecology",
    "originalNumber": 83,
    "stem": "3. FU, 32 year old G3 P1011, comes to the clinic\nand asks what is she going to do after being\nexposed to an employee at her office who became\nAFB sputum positive?",
