    "subject": "obstetrics-gynecology",
    "originalNumber": 92,
    "stem": "12. A 12 year old female came in for consult due to\namenorrhea. Upon physical examination, pubic and\naxillary hair was absent and a blind vaginal pouch\nwas seen. Which of the following tests would\nconfirm your impression?",
