    "correctChoice": "D",
    "explanation": "Page 10 of OB2 Topnotch Handout. The diagnosis is\nabruptio placenta. Risk factors: Hypertension,\nadvanced maternal age, increased parity. Signs and\nsymptoms: Significant bleeding after 20 weeks\ngestation. Uterine hypertonus manifested by rigid\nabdomen and tender uterus. FHR is 100 (fetal\ndistress).",
