    "subject": "obstetrics-gynecology",
    "originalNumber": 137,
    "stem": "A 33-year old patient, nulligravid, comes to your\nclinic due to a 3 year hisotry of dull, aching pain\nduring menstruation. On pelvic examination, you\nnote a tender, retroverted uterus, with uterosacral\nnodularity. The most likely diagnosis is:",
