    "stem": "MGB, a 16 year old was brought by her mother due\nto cessation of menses, you asked her menstrual\nhistory and noted that she started her menses at\n12 years old and was subsequently regular\noccuring every 28-30 days but suddenly ceased for\n3 months. All other physical examination findings\nwere normal, you noted that the most common\ncause of secondary amenorrhea is",
