    "stem": "A 34 year old multigravid at 35 weeks and 3 days\nAOG presents for a prenatal check up. After\nperforming the Leopold's maneuver, you\ndiscovered that the fetus is in a transverse lie. If\nthis abnormal lie is due to a placental abnormality,\nwhich condition is most likely present?",
