    "stem": "The results of a biophysical profile done to a 40\nyear old G1P0 at 32 weeks and 4 days AOG with\nsuspected intrauterine growth restriction are as\nfollows: Reactive NST, AFV 1 cm, 2 discrete body\nmovements, 1 episode of breathing lasting >30\nseconds, 2 episodes of extension with return to\nflexion. What should you do next?",
