    "subject": "obstetrics-gynecology",
    "originalNumber": 265,
    "stem": "A G2P2 patient is in labor undergoes pelvic\nexamination revealing vesicular lesions in the\ngenital area. You are highly suspecting a herpes\nsimplex infection. How will you manage this\npatient?",
