    "stem": "A 19 year old G1P0, 14-15 weeks AOG, consulted\ndue to vaginal bleeding. Vital signs were stable.\nFundic height was noted at 23 cm. Internal exam:\ncervix is soft, long and closed with uterus enlarged\nto 5 months size. UTZ showed a complex,\nechogenic mass with numerous cystic spaces with\nno fetus and aminotic sac seen. Serum Beta HCG is\nelevated at 170,000 miU/mL. What is the most\nappropriate management for this case?",
