    "stem": "A 40 year old G4P3 (3003), 31-32 weeks AOG,\nknown hypertensive and a heavy smoker was\nbrought to the ER due to severe hypogastric pain\nand vaginal bleeding. BP 140/90, HR 100/min, RR\n21/min. FH 32 cm, FHT 90-100/min, LM1-cephalic,\nuterine contractions - every 2 minutes with a\nstrong intensity, (+) uterine tenderness. What is\nthe best management for this case?",
