    "correctChoice": "A",
    "explanation": "Laporotomy is usually indicated for patient who are\nhemodynamically unstable or for those with\ncornual pregnancies. Methotrexate therapy is only\ndone when the ff. criteria are met:\npatient should be hemodynamically stable with no\nsigns of hemoperitoneum\ngestational sac should be <=4cm\nno fetal cardiac activity\nno tubal rupture\nbeta HCG less than 5000 mIU/mL",
