    "stem": "A G1P0 on her 34th week AOG underwent a\nBiophysical Assesment which revealed the\nfollowing: 1.)Reactive NST, 2.)One breathing\nperiod lasting 10 seconds, 3.) 2 discrete\nmovements of arms, 4.) One definite extension and\nreturn to flexion, 5.) AF volume with the largest\npocket at 1 cm. What would be the nest step of the\nOB-GYN?",
    "choices": [
      {
        "label": "A",
        "text": "Observe and repeat per protocol"
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "Repeat BPF in 24 hours"
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "Repeat test weekly"
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "Do a CST"
      },
      {
        "label": "E",
        "text": "Deliver"
      }
    ],
    "correctChoice": "E",
    "explanation": "BPS is 4 with an abnormal AFV hence protocol\nstates that delivery should be prompted.",
