    "subject": "obstetrics-gynecology",
    "originalNumber": 437,
    "stem": "A 27-year old G3P2 mother who is now at her 14\nweeks AOG, is rushed to the OB ER after\ncomplaining of minimal vaginal spotting. She is\nafebrile with normal BP and heart rate. On IE, her\ncervix is closed with uterine size estimating 10\nweeks AOG. Which of the following is the next best\nstep?",
