    "correctChoice": "B",
    "explanation": "The manifestations are most consistent with a case\nof missed abortion. Expected findings in the UTZ\ninclude an empty gestational sac in blighted ovum\nor a fetus without cardiac activity. Elective D&C is\nComplete abortion will have no bleeding and will\nshow an empty cavity on UTZ.",
