    "explanation": "Cocaine is a a small molecule which is able to cross\nthe placenta into the bloodstream of the fetus.\nCocaine-using pregnant women deliver\nprematurely. There are also data showing that\nspontaneous abortion and low birth weight. The\nincreased risk of placental abruption with cocaine\nuse has been well documented.",
