    "correctChoice": "C",
    "explanation": "Abdominal enlargement, changes in the servix,\nhegar's sign, goodell's sign, braxton hick's\ncontractions, ballottement, physical outlining of\nfetus in the uterus and positive pregnancy test are\nthe probable evidence of pregnancy.",
