    "subject": "obstetrics-gynecology",
    "originalNumber": 456,
    "stem": "A 30 year-old, who just delivered a healthy male\nneonate, had fever, hypogastric pain and odorous\nvaginal discharge. Infection developed is most\nlikely in the form of:",
