    "subject": "obstetrics-gynecology",
    "originalNumber": 458,
    "stem": "A 32 year-old, G1P0 at term suddenly had severe\ncontinuous low abdominal pain and tenderness\nassociated with hypotension, tachycradia and\nnonreassuring fetal heart tone. She is most\nprobably having:",
