    "id": "superexam-obstetrics-gynecology-0460",
    "subject": "obstetrics-gynecology",
    "originalNumber": 460,
    "stem": "A 27 year-old woman who has been amenorrheic\nfor 12 weeks has an elevated serum HCG titer. D&C\nwas performed on the patient due to an incomplete\nabortion. Pathology report was available\ndescribing a generalized trophoblastic\nproliferation, hydropic villi without blood vessels\nand fetal parts. Diagnosis is most likely:",
