    "subject": "obstetrics-gynecology",
    "originalNumber": 469,
    "stem": "A 55 year old nulligravid presents with\namenorrhea for 6 months followed by irregular\nvaginal bleeding. Endometrial sampling done\nwhich shows complex hyperplasia with atypia.\nWhat is your management?",
