    "stem": "A 32 year old primigravid went to your clinic\ncomplaining of loss of perceived fetal movements.\nThe fetus is 33 3/7 weeks AOG by early ultrasound.\nYou did a biophysical profile (BPP) with a score of\n6 with normal AFV. Lung maturity testing revealed\nL/S ratio of 2. What is your next step in\nmanagement?",
