    "originalNumber": 608,
    "stem": "A 19 year old G1P0 PU 40 weeks, not in labor, was\nseen at the OPD for decreased fetal movement. She\nwas hooked to an electronic fetal monitor and\ntracing showed: Baseline FHT- 140’s, good\nvariability, with more than 2 accelerations of 20\nbpm lasting for 20 secs. The tracing is interpreted\nas:",
