    "explanation": "Reactive non-stress test biophysical scoring (8-10)\nshows normal findings and indicates favorable fetal\nsurvival. A non-reactive non-stress test (< 6) refers\nto poor fetal condition and may be an indication for\nan emergent delivery.",
