    "stem": "A 33 year-old G3P2 (2002) went to OPD due to\nspotting. Her LMP was 28 weeks ago and she\nclaims that she has not felt any fetal movement for\nthe past month. On examination, fundal height is\n18 cm, no fetal heart tone detected. Ultrasound\nwas done, revealing no cardiac acitivity.\nManagement of this patient would be:",
