    "id": "superexam-obstetrics-gynecology-0641",
    "subject": "obstetrics-gynecology",
    "originalNumber": 641,
    "stem": "Maja Rotzky, a 19 y/o primigravid consulted on\nyour clinic for her first prenatal check-up. The\nfundic height was measured to be at the level of\numbilicus. Assuming that this is NOT a mutifetal\npregnancy and there is NO structural, or medical\nabnormality, approximately how many weeks AOG\nis this pregnancy?",
