    "correctChoice": "D",
    "explanation": "at 12 weeks, FH is at the level of symphysis pubis.\nAt 16 weeks, FH is halfway between the symphysis\nand umbilicus. At 20 weeks at the level of\numbilicus. At 32 weeks about the level of xiphoid\nprocess.",
