    "stem": "A 26 yo, G1P1 (1001) complains of amenorrhea.\nShe had hypotensive episodes during her delivery\n7 months ago and was transfused 10 units of fresh\nwhole blood. She was not able to breastfeed\nbecause her breasts started to sag. She also lost\nweight, became anorexic and weak. What explains\nthe amenorrhea in this patient?",
